  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#runtime-script-errors-2:dom-errorevent-colno\r\n\r\n> the error attribute initialized to null\r\nI think it is better to have this sentence in \"If special error event handling is true\" of step 4 in \"The event handler processing algorithm\" as well.\r\nFor example, \"The fifth argument should be initialized to null for dedicated workers.\"\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm\r\n",
